; Depth-2 abstract trie, 3 heads, grandchild {x}: the concrete space is a subset of {ε,0,1,2,0.x,1.x,2.x} so ∪ is EXACT on the cells.  The transfer is the current `Shape.union`: ε by `or`, tracked children by `or` of `under`, others.hi by +, others.lo by max of each side DISCOUNTED by the keys the other side newly tracks, otherTail by `or` per-channel.  Theorem: A ∈ γ(a) ∧ B ∈ γ(b) ⇒ A∪B ∈ γ(a ∪# b).
